    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">New construction services</span><h1>Build comfort and efficiency into the project from day one.</h1><p>EcoPower coordinates insulation, air sealing, and building-envelope details for new homes, additions, renovations, and light-commercial construction across Maryland.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary open-contact" href="#contact">Discuss Your Project</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#process">See Our Process</a></div><div class="hero-proof"><span>Builder coordination</span><span>Building-science approach</span><span>Documented installation</span></div></div>
